s G2 and G5.\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:60:### G12. Cross-company concepts and aggregation need formal mapping semantics\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:62:Requirements: MC02, MC06, MC07, MC20, MC24. Refines G2, G4 and G7.\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:79:### G13. Multiple clocks are identified without complete historical query rules\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:81:Requirements: MC05, MC19, MC25. Refines G2, G4 and G10.\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:98:### G14. Scenario modes and permitted information need enforceable contracts\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:119:### G15. Different kinds of uncertainty need different admissibility rules\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:138:### G16. Aggregation and history compression need a practical resolution policy\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:156:### G17. Local evidence review needs a state machine and invalidation rules\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:158:Requirements: MC04, MC27. Refines G2, G5 and G10.\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:174:### G18. Reproducibility needs identity and replay definitions, not only fields\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:193:## Completion consequences\\\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:213:## Evidence and limits of this pass\\\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:7:## Question, baseline and skeptical audit\\\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:33:## Findings\\\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:47:### G1. Reconstruction defines the answer more precisely than the algorithm\\\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:73:### G2. The normative language and IR contracts remain incomplete\\\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:98:### G3. Ordinary disclosure uncertainty can leave the pro